  "Specification": "MCCheckpointCoordination: A model-checking configuration module for CheckpointCoordination. Bounds Nat and LogIndex to finite ranges via MaxNat and MaxLog, defines a state constraint to keep open indices non-empty, declares node symmetry for TLC, and provides an intentionally incorrect variant of ShouldReplaceLease that also allows replacement when the current lease node equals the Leader.",
